You are drafting an email reply on behalf of {{ $json.senderName }}, who received the email below.

{{ $json.contactName ? ("The sender is a known contact: " + $json.contactName + ".\n\n") : "" }}Instructions for this sender: {{ $json.senderNotes || "(none)" }}

